WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.767
Open Request via chat from the Bitcoin vault. This wallet uses Testnet and has no funds.

2
00:00:04.767 --> 00:00:11.833
Enter 25,000 sats and a memo. The app also shows the amount in BTC and a fiat estimate.

3
00:00:11.833 --> 00:00:18.300
Review the amount, memo and Testnet receiving address, then choose Send request.

4
00:00:18.300 --> 00:00:26.267
Choose the demo contact. With this peer offline, the request is saved locally in the conversation.

5
00:00:26.267 --> 00:00:31.267
The chat card shows 0.00025000 BTC, 25,000 sats, the memo and Awaiting payment.

6
00:00:31.267 --> 00:00:35.567
Payment details keep the network, receiving address, amount and memo together.

7
00:00:35.567 --> 00:00:39.533
Request created. No Bitcoin payment is signed or broadcast in this demo.
